  <h1>How to Make Ramen</h1> 

  <h2>What You Need</h2> 
  <ul> 
    <li>1 ramen packet</li>
    <li>500ml water</li>
    <li>1 egg</li>
    <li>Green onions</li>
    <li>A pot</li>
  </ul> 

  <h2>Steps</h2> 
  <ol> 
    <li>Boil 500ml of water in a pot.</li>
    <li><strong>Be careful when handling the hot water.</strong></li>
    <li>Add the ramen noodles and cook for 3 minutes.</li>
    <li>Add the seasoning packet and <em>stir well</em>.</li>
    <li>Add an egg and green onions if you like.</li>
    <li>Serve the ramen while it is hot.</li>
  </ol> 
